# =====================================================================
# Component 1: Machine Learning Binary Artifacts
# Justification: Binary model weights (*.pt, *.onnx) are large (>10MB-100MB)
# and non-diffable in Git. They must be stored in releases or external storage.
# =====================================================================
component_1_edge_ai/models/*.pt
component_1_edge_ai/models/*.onnx
component_1_edge_ai/models/*.engine
component_1_edge_ai/models/*.tflite
component_1_edge_ai/models/*.joblib

# =====================================================================
# Component 1: Datasets, Images, and Local Storage
# Justification: High-frequency camera frames and SQLite databases cause
# Git bloat and write lock issues across collaborators.
# =====================================================================
component_1_edge_ai/data/*.db
component_1_edge_ai/data/*.sqlite3
component_1_edge_ai/data/*.csv
component_1_edge_ai/data/captured_frames/
component_1_edge_ai/data/dataset/
component_1_edge_ai/data/*.png
component_1_edge_ai/data/*.jpg

# =====================================================================
# Operational Logs & OS Metadata
# =====================================================================
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db